hat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T05:19:58Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "Ded", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T05:20:17Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "My worst slip was calling my 68 year old boss bro", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T05:20:54Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "I called one of my senior colleagues lucky bastard once🤣🤣", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T05:21:04Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "He was chill but I profusely apologised", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T05:21:29Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "I also swear profusely and it percolates into professional spaces\nQuite terrifying NGL", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T05:21:30Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "He was one of the good ones", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T05:22:54Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "I hope someone calls me that at that age. A good chuckle time.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]